# multi-dim-manager

cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "multi-dim-manager: multi-dimensional experiment state manager"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
date-created: 2026-10-14
authors:
  - family-names: "Shi"
    given-names: "Jiaming"
